---
description:
  A state diagram under the layered layout, with start and end states, a
  composite state, a choice, a fork and join, transition labels and a note.
config:
  layout: layered
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state Checking <<choice>>
  state Split <<fork>>
  state Merge <<join>>
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Running : start
  state Running {
    [*] --> Working
    Working --> Paused : pause
    Paused --> Working : resume
  }
  Running --> Checking : finish
  Checking --> Split : ok
  Checking --> Idle : retry
  Split --> Archive
  Split --> Notify
  Archive --> Merge
  Notify --> Merge
  Merge --> [*]
  note right of Idle : waiting for input
